# How to use SDL library in a project

# I build the SDL library for my system, then link the library.

Steps: 

mkdir sdl
cd sdl
git clone "github Link for sdl" # this will create a "SDL" folder
cmake --build ./src/dep/sdl/SDL/build --parallel 4

# This will create a "Makefile" inside
# This will create a shared object file:  libSDL3.so.{verison} inside

# I can now link this library in my project.